window.MastrifyPages={home:'<section class="analysis-intro wrap"><div class="analysis-head"><p class="eyebrow">Before you master</p><h2>Understand your mix <span>with clarity</span></h2><p>Perceptual analysis highlights dynamics, balance, and release readiness, so you know what your song needs before the final master.</p><a class="text-link" href="/analyze">Run a free mix analysis ↗</a></div><div class="studio-strip"><span>SEAMLESS WITH YOUR STUDIO</span><h2>Trusted by producers and artists worldwide</h2><div>Ableton Live <i>/</i> FL Studio <i>/</i> Logic Pro <i>/</i> Pro Tools <i>/</i> Studio One</div></div><div class="intelligence-list"><div><span>01</span><strong>Musical intelligence</strong><p class="">Adapts to your material</p></div><div><span>02</span><strong>Transparent dynamics</strong><p class="">Punch and movement preserved</p></div><div><span>03</span><strong>Release-ready</strong><p class="">Streaming loudness targets</p></div></div></section><section class="release-cta wrap"><p class="eyebrow">RELEASE READY</p><h2>Ready to master your track?</h2><p>Studio-grade loudness and tone, pay when your export is ready.</p><a class="button primary" href="/master">Start mastering ↗</a></section>',"how-it-works":'<section class="why-hero"><p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>Intelligent mastering</p><h1 data-reveal style="--i:1">How your music <span>becomes release-ready</span></h1><p class="why-lead" data-reveal style="--i:2">From the first listen to the final master, Mastrify shapes loudness, tone, and space around your music.</p><ul class="why-pillars"><li data-reveal style="--i:3"><i></i><span>Perceptual processing that follows the music, not a fixed template</span></li><li data-reveal style="--i:4"><i></i><span>Transparency when your material already speaks clearly</span></li><li data-reveal style="--i:5"><i></i><span>Loudness and tone shaped with restraint and intent</span></li></ul><div class="why-actions" data-reveal style="--i:6"><a class="button primary" href="/master">Start mastering ↗</a> <a class="text-link" href="/analyze">Analyze a mix first ↗</a></div></section><section class="why-method" id="why-method" aria-label="The path to your master"><div class="why-method-side"><div class="why-method-intro"><p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>The path to your master</p><h2 data-reveal style="--i:1">Six stages of intelligent care</h2><p data-reveal style="--i:2">Each step is deliberate, built to support your mix, not overwrite it.</p></div><div class="why-brain"><div class="why-brain-disc"><div id="brain-slot"></div><div class="why-brain-ring" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="why-brain-head" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div></div><p class="why-brain-readout"><span>MASTRIFY / NEURAL ENGINE</span><b>STAGE 00 / 06</b></p></div></div><ol class="why-stages"><li data-reveal><span>01</span><h3>Upload your mix</h3><p>Start with your stereo mix. Every detail shapes the master.</p></li><li data-reveal><span>02</span><h3>Perceptual analysis</h3><p>Map dynamics, tone, stereo balance, and energy.</p></li><li data-reveal><span>03</span><h3>Dynamic &amp; tonal shaping</h3><p>Refine tone and clarity while preserving movement and punch.</p></li><li data-reveal><span>04</span><h3>Stereo &amp; spatial refinement</h3><p>Bring width and depth into focus while keeping the centre strong.</p></li><li data-reveal><span>05</span><h3>Intelligent loudness</h3><p>Reach your loudness goal with care for the music’s dynamics.</p></li><li data-reveal><span>06</span><h3>Release-ready master</h3><p>A polished master that keeps your identity, ready for release.</p></li></ol></section><section class="why-band" aria-label="Mastering philosophy"><p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>Mastering philosophy</p><h2 data-reveal style="--i:1">Smart transparency, the mix stays yours</h2><p data-reveal style="--i:2">Great mastering is often about what you choose not to do. Mastrify earns each move of the chain, so punch, space, and emotion survive the journey to release.</p><div class="why-cards"><div data-reveal><h3>Punch and movement stay</h3><p>Transient life and groove are treated as musical features, not problems to flatten away.</p></div><div data-reveal style="--i:1"><h3>Adapts to your material</h3><p>Dense, dynamic, or already-loud mixes each get a different amount of care, never a one-size chain.</p></div><div data-reveal style="--i:2"><h3>Earned processing</h3><p>When the mix is already balanced, the engine holds back instead of pushing for effect.</p></div><div data-reveal style="--i:3"><h3>Musical loudness</h3><p>Level is guided toward your target with judgment, not brute-force limiting for a number on a meter.</p></div><div data-reveal style="--i:4"><h3>Dynamic material respected</h3><p>Songs that breathe keep their contrast; the master supports the performance you captured.</p></div><div data-reveal style="--i:5"><h3>Reference-aware tone</h3><p>Optional reference tracks inform subtle tonal balance without copying someone else’s level.</p></div></div></section><section class="why-band" aria-label="Before you upload"><p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>Before you upload</p><h2 data-reveal style="--i:1">Give your mix a little room to breathe</h2><div class="why-two"><p data-reveal style="--i:2">Clean, unclipped mixes with some dynamic space usually produce the most transparent masters. You do not need to hit a specific peak level, just avoid slamming the bus if you want the most open result.</p><p data-reveal style="--i:3">Already heavily limited or loud? That is fine. The engine reads the material and adapts, supporting what is there instead of fighting it.</p></div><p class="why-habits-title" data-reveal>Helpful habits</p><ul class="why-habits"><li data-reveal><b>01</b><span>Leave a little headroom on your stereo bus, not for rules, but for clarity.</span></li><li data-reveal style="--i:1"><b>02</b><span>Check that nothing is clipping before export; distortion limits what mastering can recover.</span></li><li data-reveal style="--i:2"><b>03</b><span>Trust your ears: if the mix already feels finished, choose a gentler loudness goal.</span></li><li data-reveal style="--i:3"><b>04</b><span>Use analyze first if you are unsure, it highlights what the song may need.</span></li></ul></section><section class="why-trust" aria-label="Built for real music"><p class="eyebrow" data-reveal>Built for real music</p><h2 data-reveal style="--i:1">Engineered for trust at every stage</h2><div class="why-chips"><span data-reveal>Transient-safe processing</span><span data-reveal style="--i:1">Adaptive loudness</span><span data-reveal style="--i:2">Stereo-aware analysis</span><span data-reveal style="--i:3">Musical dynamics preserved</span><span data-reveal style="--i:4">Reference-aware tonal balance</span><span data-reveal style="--i:5">Material-aware decisions</span></div></section><section class="why-close"><p data-reveal>Ready when your mix is.</p><a class="button primary" href="/master" data-reveal style="--i:1">Master your track ↗</a></section>',pricing:'<section class="page-head pricing-head wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Simple, honest pricing</p><h1>One master. Full quality.</h1><p>Hear your master first. Pay when you’re ready to export.</p></section><section class="pricing-layout wrap"><div class="price-panel"><div class="price-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR SOUND. FULLY REALIZED.</p><h2>Studio-quality master</h2></div><img class="price-mark" src="/assets/logo.svg" alt=""></div><div class="price-line"><div class="price"><span>$</span>9<span>.00</span></div><p>USD per master<br><span>No subscription</span></p></div><ul class="source-list price-includes"><li>Full-quality WAV export</li><li>Streaming-ready loudness</li><li>Musical dynamics preserved</li></ul><a class="button primary" href="/master">Start mastering ↗</a><p class="price-footnote">Pay only when your master is ready.</p></div><div class="price-details"><p class="eyebrow">FROM MIX TO RELEASE</p><h2>Your music. <br>Its full potential.</h2><p>Choose your style and loudness goal. Listen to the result, then export when it feels right.</p><ol class="price-steps"><li><span>01</span><div><strong>Upload</strong><small>Your stereo mix, read straight in the browser.</small></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><strong>Settings</strong><small>Pick a character and a loudness goal.</small></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><strong>Master</strong><small>Compare it with your original, then export.</small></div></li></ol><a class="text-link" href="/how-it-works">Discover the process ↗</a><p class="retention">Try checkout here in test mode. No payment is collected; the demo WAV contains your original audio.</p></div></section><section class="price-assurance wrap"><p class="eyebrow">WHY THE PRICE IS THIS SIMPLE</p><div class="assurance-row"><div><h3>No subscription</h3><p>One price for each export. No tiers to compare, nothing recurring.</p></div><div><h3>Hear it before you pay</h3><p>Your master plays back against the original, so you decide with your ears.</p></div><div><h3>Analysis stays free</h3><p>Run a perceptual mix analysis whenever you like, with no export needed.</p></div></div><a class="button primary" href="/master">Start mastering ↗</a></section>',about:'<section class="page-head wrap"><p class="eyebrow">About</p><h1>About <span>Mastrify</span></h1><p>Mastrify is an AI-powered mastering tool built for modern artists.</p></section><section class="about-layout wrap"><div class="about-card flow-surface"><span class="contact-mark" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/logo.svg" alt=""></span><p class="eyebrow">WHY WE BUILT IT</p><h2>Professional sound, without the friction.</h2><p>We believe every creator should be able to get professional sound without expensive engineers or complicated workflows.</p><p>Upload your track. Get a master that sounds like Spotify-ready releases, shaped with perceptual intelligence that preserves punch, space, and emotional movement.</p><div class="about-facts"><div><strong>Pay per export</strong><span>$9 per master, no subscription</span></div><div><strong>Analysis stays free</strong><span>Understand your mix before you commit</span></div><div><strong>Your files stay yours</strong><span>Full ownership, always</span></div></div><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href="/master">Start mastering ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="/how-it-works">See how Mastrify works ↗</a></div></div><aside class="contact-aside"><p class="eyebrow">FOLLOW ALONG</p><a class="contact-mail" href="https://www.instagram.com/mastrify.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram <span>↗</span></a><a class="contact-mail" href="https://www.tiktok.com/@mastrify.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener">TikTok <span>↗</span></a><p>Designed &amp; engineered by <a href="https://lunov.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Lunov</a>.</p></aside></section>',blog:'<section class="page-head wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Blog</p><h1>Articles and product updates are on the way.</h1><p>Notes on mastering, loudness, and how the engine listens. Nothing published yet.</p></section><section class="about-layout wrap"><div class="about-card flow-surface blog-empty"><span class="contact-mark" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/logo.svg" alt=""></span><p class="eyebrow">COMING SOON</p><h2>The first posts are being written.</h2><p>Until then, the best place to start is the explanation of how Mastrify works, and a free analysis of your own mix.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href="/analyze">Analyze your mix ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="/how-it-works">See how Mastrify works ↗</a></div></div><aside class="contact-aside"><p class="eyebrow">FOLLOW ALONG</p><a class="contact-mail" href="https://www.instagram.com/mastrify.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram <span>↗</span></a><a class="contact-mail" href="https://www.tiktok.com/@mastrify.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener">TikTok <span>↗</span></a><p>New posts land here and on social first.</p></aside></section>',contact:'<section class="page-head wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Support</p><h1>Contact</h1><p>Questions about mastering, exports, or billing? Send a support ticket and we will get back to you, typically within one business day.</p></section><section class="contact-layout wrap"><form class="contact-card" id="support-form" novalidate><span class="contact-mark" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/logo.svg" alt=""></span><p class="eyebrow">SEND A SUPPORT TICKET</p><h2>Tell us what you need.</h2><p class="contact-lead">Goes directly to our support inbox. Include your track name and what you need help with, and for export or payment issues, when your master finished.</p><div class="contact-body"><label class="contact-field"><span class="contact-label">Email</span><input id="support-email" type="email" autocomplete="email" inputmode="email" maxlength="160" placeholder="you@example.com"></label><label class="contact-field"><span class="contact-label">Name <small>(optional)</small></span><input id="support-name" type="text" autocomplete="name" maxlength="80" placeholder="Your name"></label><div class="contact-field"><span class="contact-label" id="topic-label">Topic</span><div class="topic-picker" data-value="Processing problem" data-tone="amber"><button type="button" class="topic-button" id="topic-button" aria-haspopup="listbox" aria-expanded="false" aria-labelledby="topic-label topic-button"><i class="topic-dot" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="topic-current">Processing problem</span><em class="topic-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></em></button><ul class="topic-list" role="listbox" aria-labelledby="topic-label" hidden><li role="option" tabindex="-1" data-topic="Processing problem" data-tone="amber" aria-selected="true"><i class="topic-dot" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="topic-name">Processing problem</span><small>The upload or the render stopped</small></li><li role="option" tabindex="-1" data-topic="Master sounds wrong" data-tone="violet" aria-selected="false"><i class="topic-dot" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="topic-name">Master sounds wrong</span><small>The result is not what you expected</small></li><li role="option" tabindex="-1" data-topic="Payment or account" data-tone="blue" aria-selected="false"><i class="topic-dot" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="topic-name">Payment or account</span><small>Checkout, receipts and refunds</small></li><li role="option" tabindex="-1" data-topic="Something is broken" data-tone="coral" aria-selected="false"><i class="topic-dot" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="topic-name">Something is broken</span><small>A button, a page or an export misbehaves</small></li><li role="option" tabindex="-1" data-topic="Something else" data-tone="neutral" aria-selected="false"><i class="topic-dot" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="topic-name">Something else</span><small>Anything the four above do not cover</small></li></ul></div></div><label class="contact-field"><span class="contact-label">Message</span><textarea id="support-message" rows="6" maxlength="1500" placeholder="What you were doing, and what you need help with."></textarea></label></div><button class="button primary" type="submit" id="support-send">Send ticket <span>↗</span></button><p class="contact-status" id="support-status" role="status"></p></form><div class="contact-aside"><p class="eyebrow">PREFER PLAIN EMAIL?</p><a class="contact-mail" href="mailto:hello@mastrify.com">hello@mastrify.com <span>↗</span></a><p>Backup option if the form is unavailable. Same inbox, same reply time.</p></div><p class="contact-explore">Prefer to explore first? <a class="text-link" href="/how-it-works">See how Mastrify works ↗</a></p></section>',analyze:"",master:""};
