MastrifyPages.privacy='<section class="doc-hero"><p class="eyebrow" data-rise>Legal</p><h1 data-rise style="--i:1">Privacy <span>Policy</span></h1><p class="doc-lead" data-rise style="--i:2">How Mastrify handles your audio, your data, and your trust, in plain language.</p><ul class="doc-pillars"><li data-rise style="--i:3"><i aria-hidden="true"></i><span>You keep every right to your compositions, recordings and masters.</span></li><li data-rise style="--i:4"><i aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Your audio is never sold, licensed or distributed to third parties.</span></li><li data-rise style="--i:5"><i aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Links and the files behind them last 12 hours, then they expire.</span></li></ul><p class="doc-stamp" data-rise style="--i:6">Last updated 2026<b aria-hidden="true">·</b><a class="text-link" href="/terms">Terms of Service ↗</a></p></section><section class="doc-body"><div class="doc-side"><div class="doc-side-head"><p class="eyebrow">On this page</p><h2>Five short sections.</h2></div><ol class="doc-index"><li><button type="button" data-target="privacy-1"><b>01</b><span>Your music stays yours</span></button></li><li><button type="button" data-target="privacy-2"><b>02</b><span>How we use uploads</span></button></li><li><button type="button" data-target="privacy-3"><b>03</b><span>Storage and retention</span></button></li><li><button type="button" data-target="privacy-4"><b>04</b><span>Payments</span></button></li><li><button type="button" data-target="privacy-5"><b>05</b><span>Security</span></button></li></ol></div><ol class="doc-sections"><li id="privacy-1" data-rise><span aria-hidden="true">01</span><h3>Your music stays yours</h3><p>You retain full ownership of every track you upload. Mastrify does not claim rights to your compositions, recordings, or masters. We provide analysis and mastering as a service on your material, nothing more.</p></li><li id="privacy-2" data-rise><span aria-hidden="true">02</span><h3>How we use uploads</h3><ul class="doc-list"><li>Files are used only to run the mix analysis or mastering you request.</li><li>We do not sell, license, or distribute your audio to third parties.</li><li>Processing is limited to delivering previews, playback links, and exports back to you.</li></ul></li><li id="privacy-3" data-rise><span aria-hidden="true">03</span><h3>Storage and retention</h3><p>Uploads, generated masters, and preview files may be stored temporarily so we can complete your session and deliver results.</p><p>Playback and download links, including links to preview your master, are available for 12 hours from when they are issued. After that window, links may expire and associated files may be deleted automatically.</p><p class="doc-mark">Mastrify is not long-term cloud storage. Keep your own backups of original mixes and final exports.</p></li><li id="privacy-4" data-rise><span aria-hidden="true">04</span><h3>Payments</h3><p>When you pay for an export, payment is handled through Stripe and other secure payment providers. Mastrify does not store full card numbers on our servers. Billing applies to the specific master export you choose to unlock after your preview is ready.</p></li><li id="privacy-5" data-rise><span aria-hidden="true">05</span><h3>Security</h3><p>We use industry-standard practices to protect data in transit and at rest. No system is perfectly secure. If you believe your account or upload was compromised, contact us promptly through our support form.</p></li></ol></section><section class="doc-close"><p class="eyebrow" data-rise>Still wondering?</p><h2 data-rise style="--i:1">Ask us, we answer within one business day.</h2><div class="doc-actions" data-rise style="--i:2"><a class="button primary" href="/contact">Contact us ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="/terms">Read the Terms of Service ↗</a></div><p class="doc-note">Policy text from the live Mastrify service. Audio selected in this local preview stays on your device. No payment is collected here.</p></section>',MastrifyPages.terms='<section class="doc-hero"><p class="eyebrow" data-rise>Legal</p><h1 data-rise style="--i:1">Terms of <span>Service</span></h1><p class="doc-lead" data-rise style="--i:2">The essentials for using Mastrify fairly, safely, and with confidence in what you are buying.</p><ul class="doc-pillars"><li data-rise style="--i:3"><i aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Upload only what you own or control the rights to.</span></li><li data-rise style="--i:4"><i aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Nine dollars for each export, no subscription, paid after your preview.</span></li><li data-rise style="--i:5"><i aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Download within 12 hours, links expire after that window.</span></li></ul><p class="doc-stamp" data-rise style="--i:6">Last updated 2026<b aria-hidden="true">·</b><a class="text-link" href="/privacy">Privacy Policy ↗</a></p></section><section class="doc-body"><div class="doc-side"><div class="doc-side-head"><p class="eyebrow">On this page</p><h2>Six short sections.</h2></div><ol class="doc-index"><li><button type="button" data-target="terms-1"><b>01</b><span>Your responsibilities</span></button></li><li><button type="button" data-target="terms-2"><b>02</b><span>The service</span></button></li><li><button type="button" data-target="terms-3"><b>03</b><span>Payments and delivery</span></button></li><li><button type="button" data-target="terms-4"><b>04</b><span>Storage and availability</span></button></li><li><button type="button" data-target="terms-5"><b>05</b><span>Provided “as is”</span></button></li><li><button type="button" data-target="terms-6"><b>06</b><span>Changes</span></button></li></ol></div><ol class="doc-sections"><li id="terms-1" data-rise><span aria-hidden="true">01</span><h3>Your responsibilities</h3><ul class="doc-list"><li>You must own or control the rights to everything you upload.</li><li>Do not upload illegal, infringing, or unauthorized material.</li><li>You are responsible for how you use exported masters on platforms and releases.</li></ul></li><li id="terms-2" data-rise><span aria-hidden="true">02</span><h3>The service</h3><p>Mastrify provides on-demand mix analysis and digital mastering. Results depend on your source material, settings, and technical constraints. We aim for release-ready quality but cannot guarantee a specific commercial outcome for every mix.</p></li><li id="terms-3" data-rise><span aria-hidden="true">03</span><h3>Payments and delivery</h3><ul class="doc-list"><li>Mastering is delivered as a digital product, previews and paid full exports.</li><li>Each master export is $9.00 USD via secure Stripe checkout after your preview is ready.</li><li>Payment applies to the export you unlock once your master has been generated.</li><li>No refunds after a successful export has been delivered and made available for download.</li></ul></li><li id="terms-4" data-rise><span aria-hidden="true">04</span><h3>Storage and availability</h3><ul class="doc-list"><li>Previews, playback links, and download links are available for 12 hours from when they are issued.</li><li>After 12 hours, links may expire and associated files may be removed from our systems.</li><li>You are responsible for downloading and backing up exported masters within that window.</li><li>Mastrify does not guarantee permanent cloud storage unless we explicitly state otherwise.</li></ul></li><li id="terms-5" data-rise><span aria-hidden="true">05</span><h3>Provided “as is”</h3><p>The service is provided on an “as is” and “as available” basis. To the extent permitted by law, we disclaim warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, and non-infringement. Our liability is limited to the amount you paid for the affected export in the preceding transaction.</p></li><li id="terms-6" data-rise><span aria-hidden="true">06</span><h3>Changes</h3><p>We may update these terms as the product evolves. Continued use after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.</p></li></ol></section><section class="doc-close"><p class="eyebrow" data-rise>Still wondering?</p><h2 data-rise style="--i:1">Ask us, we answer within one business day.</h2><div class="doc-actions" data-rise style="--i:2"><a class="button primary" href="/contact">Contact us ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="/privacy">Read the Privacy Policy ↗</a></div><p class="doc-note">Policy text from the live Mastrify service. Audio selected in this local preview stays on your device. No payment is collected here.</p></section>';
